      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FRED'S FURY (7) hit the ground running from out wide last start and crossed down to lead throughout (22.67) at Geelong in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 over 400m. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from four starts. Can continue the winning form. CRACKERJACK GREG (8) missed the frame latest when fifth at Horsham (23.92) but was a winner four back in the best time of the program. Should be about the money. MIDNIGHT REBEL (6) broke well and quickly mustered speed to win over the 390m at Warrnambool two runs back then settled forward again when finishing second at Warrnambool last start. Hard to beat again. PAW JUDD (2) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
